This section describes in detail the release contents of the module Shopping Mall Status enquiry and , where in 
shopping mall merchants can enquire on the Shopping Mall transactions which have timed out. 
When Shopping Mall payments time out, the merchant will not have BID for such transactions. For this a 
functionality is developed with which shopping mall transaction enquiry can be done without BID. Shopping mall 
transactions which have timed out can be enquired for the status and BID. A URL is fired with the details of 
transaction viz. PID, PRN, ITC, AMT and Pmt_Date (Format is yyyy-mm-dd). The transactions which match PID 
and ITC are fetched first and further filtering is done based on the AMT and Pmt_Date passed in the URL. So 
finally the merchant is shown only the payments that match the given in html format, PID, AMT, Pmt_Date and 
ITC. From the transactions displayed, user can know BID and status of the transaction. Please note that ITC has 
to be a unique number. 
An additional parameter, Pmt_Date (payment date) should be passed in the URL fired for shopping mall status 
enquiry. The payment date passed in the URL for shopping mall status enquiry should be of the format: yyyymm
dd. For example, Dec, 5th 2005 may be passed as Pmt_Date=2005-12-05. The sample url that can be used for 
